      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5bb671964fe53149c4a6496c|full_name}: \"VRChat might not be able to add this feature as they need the game to have the 13+ rating. Adding a \"hide mature avatars\" setting is basically the same as allowing mature avatars to be uploaded in the first place\"\nYes, anyone can upload mature avatars and the current rules are far too lenient. Players should be requires to mark their uploads as NSFW else risk ban if they use that model in public worlds.\nDefault hiding mature avatars as vrchats rules in public worlds should be enforced. Players should be required to register their age, so those of age can view the content.\nAdding this as an option in safety settings, would help.",
      "viewerReactions": null
